### ===== AUTH =====

### Register a new user
# @name register
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser04",
  "email": "testuser04@test.com",
  "password": "Test1234!@#$",
  "passwordConfirm": "Test1234!@#$"
}

### Login with username
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "testuser01",
  "password": "Test1234!@#$"
}

### Login with email
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "login": "testuser01@test.com",
  "password": "Test1234!@#$"
}

### Verify email (replace token manually from Mailtrap inbox)
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/verify-email?token=REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN_FROM_EMAIL


### ===== USERS =====

### Get my profile
GET http://localhost:3000/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Try without token (should return 401)
GET http://localhost:3000/users/me

### Update my profile - bio only
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bio": "Music lover and party organizer"
}

### Update my profile - music preferences
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "musicpreferences": ["rap", "rock", "jazz"]
}

### Update my profile - visibility settings
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "visibilitySettings": {
    "bio": "private",
    "musicPreferences": "friends-only"
  }
}

### Update my profile - everything at once
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bio": "Full stack music enthusiast",
  "musicpreferences": ["electro", "reggae"],
  "visibilitySettings": {
    "username": "public",
    "bio": "public",
    "musicPreferences": "public"
  }
}